# ============================================================
# Baxnaano HMS — Supabase Environment Configuration
# ============================================================
# FIIRO GAAR AH: index.html waa fayl HTML madax-banaan (single-file,
# aan build-tool lahayn — sida Vite/Webpack/Node), sidaas darteed
# browser-ku SI TOOS AH uma akhriyo fayl-kan .env. Qiimayaashan
# HORAY AYAA loogu qoray JS-ka gudaha index.html (const SUPABASE_URL /
# SUPABASE_ANON_KEY), waana kuwa app-ku dhab ahaan isticmaalo hadda.
#
# Fayl-kan .env waxaa loo hayaa kaliya:
#   - Diiwaan/reference (si aad u ogaato/u kaydiso qiimayaasha)
#   - Haddii mustaqbalka aad u guurto build-tool (Vite/Next.js/iwm)
#     oo aad rabto inaad ka akhriso .env si dhab ah
#
# Haddii aad rabto inaad beddesho project-ka Supabase (mid cusub),
# waxaad ku beddeli kartaa QIIMAYAASHAN halkan iyo sidoo kale gudaha
# index.html (SUPABASE_URL / SUPABASE_ANON_KEY, ku dhow bilowga <script>).
# ============================================================

